{
  "id": "state-championships",
  "name": "State Championships",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "State Championships, called State, Province and Territory Championships from the 2007-2008 season, handed out a promo card stamped with the championships logo from 2004, when it was a holo EX Dragon Charmeleon, to the 2015-2016 season; from 2007-2008 each card also came in a Staff copy. After 2004 they were non-holo until 2008-2009, then crosshatch holofoil from Supreme Victors' Gabite in 2009-2010 to Furious Fists' Combusken, handed out in March 2015, and a reverse holo BREAKpoint Reverse Valley last.\n\nA season's City, State and National Championships cards were often one evolution line: Charmander, Charmeleon and Charizard from EX Dragon in 2004, then Machop's line in 2005, Whismur's in 2006, Squirtle's in 2007, Shinx's in 2007-2008, Dratini's in 2008-2009, Gible's in 2009-2010, Poliwag's in 2010-2011 and Torchic's in 2014-2015. In 2012-2013 and 2013-2014 the North American State card, Vaporeon and then Leafeon, was also the card of the European spring Regional Championships.",
